# The spectrometer names at the device root: vendor-neutral aliases of this
# driver's records (geecs-epics docs/device-catalogue.md, the spectrometer
# family). A panel or a GEECS kind written against these works for any
# spectrometer driver that ships the same aliases.
# Macros: P (device prefix), R (driver)

